# МОДУЛЬ 3: ДИНАМИЧЕСКАЯ ТРЕХТОЧЕЧНАЯ ПЛОСКОСТЬ В 3D КУБЕ ( () )
# ============================================================================
class ConflictAttractorPoint3D:
    def __init__(self, name: str, initial_coords: tuple, cube_size: int = 5):
        self.name = name
        self.coords = list(initial_coords)
        self.cube_size = cube_size

    def drift_by_conflict(self, tensor_field: np.ndarray, gradient_fields: list):
        dims = 3
        best_coords = list(self.coords)
        max_tension = 0.0  # Устранение ложного дрейфа в нулевом поле

        for d in range(dims):
            for delta in [-1, 1]:
                test_coords = list(self.coords)
                test_coords[d] += delta
                
                if all(0 <= test_coords[i] < self.cube_size for i in range(dims)):
                    local_val = abs(tensor_field[tuple(test_coords)])
                    grad_val = sum(abs(gradient_fields[i][tuple(test_coords)]) for i in range(dims))
                    tension = local_val + grad_val

                    if tension > max_tension:
                        max_tension = tension
                        best_coords = test_coords

        self.coords = best_coords


class DynamicPlaneMembrane3D:
    def __init__(self, cube_size: int, p1: tuple, p2: tuple, p3: tuple):
        self.cube_size = cube_size
        self.vertex_a = ConflictAttractorPoint3D("Vertex-A", p1, cube_size)
        self.vertex_b = ConflictAttractorPoint3D("Vertex-B", p2, cube_size)
        self.vertex_c = ConflictAttractorPoint3D("Vertex-C", p3, cube_size)

    def update_membrane_position(self, tensor_field: np.ndarray, gradients: list):
        self.vertex_a.drift_by_conflict(tensor_field, gradients)
        self.vertex_b.drift_by_conflict(tensor_field, gradients)
        self.vertex_c.drift_by_conflict(tensor_field, gradients)

    def get_plane_vertices(self) -> tuple:
        return (tuple(self.vertex_a.coords), tuple(self.vertex_b.coords), tuple(self.vertex_c.coords))

    def apply_membrane_barrier(self, tensor_cube: TensorCube5x5x5):
        va = tuple(self.vertex_a.coords)
        vb = tuple(self.vertex_b.coords)
        vc = tuple(self.vertex_c.coords)

        tensor_cube.inject_quantum_impulse(va, 2)
        tensor_cube.inject_quantum_impulse(vb, 0)
        tensor_cube.inject_quantum_impulse(vc, -2)


